    "steam_appid": 2700790,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/bf39c8fb3697012f42cfd1f50b6b12e0.poster.avif?t=1755176004\" width=700 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/bf39c8fb3697012f42cfd1f50b6b12e0.webm?t=1755176004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/bf39c8fb3697012f42cfd1f50b6b12e0.mp4?t=1755176004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shepherd Knight is a game that places you in the role of a fearless shepherdess, a member of a noble order of shepherd knights. With your faithful dog by your side, your mission is to herd, guide, and protect your sheep while facing numerous challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/574a25259737c24f4cd03df3f3f60506.poster.avif?t=1755176004\" width=700 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/574a25259737c24f4cd03df3f3f60506.webm?t=1755176004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/574a25259737c24f4cd03df3f3f60506.mp4?t=1755176004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Path of Legacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mystical world filled with forgotten ruins, ancient temples, and sacred lands. Guide your magical flock and loyal dog through breathtaking landscapes as you uncover relics and secrets of an order that saw sheep as guardians of spiritual balance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/a2281818a2fd1601726710839532a1e9.poster.avif?t=1755176004\" width=700 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/a2281818a2fd1601726710839532a1e9.webm?t=1755176004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/a2281818a2fd1601726710839532a1e9.mp4?t=1755176004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Shield and the Flock</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your flock against relentless threats drawn to their magic. Wield your sword, command your companion, and face the dangers of a world where protecting your herd means preserving the legacy of the Shepherd Knights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/3ae267598660c63cd56a7b6e8e1df9f6.poster.avif?t=1755176004\" width=700 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/3ae267598660c63cd56a7b6e8e1df9f6.webm?t=1755176004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/3ae267598660c63cd56a7b6e8e1df9f6.mp4?t=1755176004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trials of the Shepherd Knights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve ancient puzzles tied to the sacred bond between shepherd, flock, and companion. Unlock hidden paths, recover lost memories, and piece together the forgotten story of a legendary order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/1da7cc54fcb9fe877516bb863423f9d8.poster.avif?t=1755176004\" width=700 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/1da7cc54fcb9fe877516bb863423f9d8.webm?t=1755176004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/1da7cc54fcb9fe877516bb863423f9d8.mp4?t=1755176004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/bf39c8fb3697012f42cfd1f50b6b12e0.poster.avif?t=1755176004\" width=700 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/bf39c8fb3697012f42cfd1f50b6b12e0.webm?t=1755176004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/bf39c8fb3697012f42cfd1f50b6b12e0.mp4?t=1755176004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shepherd Knight is a game that places you in the role of a fearless shepherdess, a member of a noble order of shepherd knights. With your faithful dog by your side, your mission is to herd, guide, and protect your sheep while facing numerous challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/574a25259737c24f4cd03df3f3f60506.poster.avif?t=1755176004\" width=700 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/574a25259737c24f4cd03df3f3f60506.webm?t=1755176004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/574a25259737c24f4cd03df3f3f60506.mp4?t=1755176004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Path of Legacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mystical world filled with forgotten ruins, ancient temples, and sacred lands. Guide your magical flock and loyal dog through breathtaking landscapes as you uncover relics and secrets of an order that saw sheep as guardians of spiritual balance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/a2281818a2fd1601726710839532a1e9.poster.avif?t=1755176004\" width=700 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/a2281818a2fd1601726710839532a1e9.webm?t=1755176004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/a2281818a2fd1601726710839532a1e9.mp4?t=1755176004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Shield and the Flock</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your flock against relentless threats drawn to their magic. Wield your sword, command your companion, and face the dangers of a world where protecting your herd means preserving the legacy of the Shepherd Knights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/3ae267598660c63cd56a7b6e8e1df9f6.poster.avif?t=1755176004\" width=700 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/3ae267598660c63cd56a7b6e8e1df9f6.webm?t=1755176004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/3ae267598660c63cd56a7b6e8e1df9f6.mp4?t=1755176004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trials of the Shepherd Knights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve ancient puzzles tied to the sacred bond between shepherd, flock, and companion. Unlock hidden paths, recover lost memories, and piece together the forgotten story of a legendary order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/1da7cc54fcb9fe877516bb863423f9d8.poster.avif?t=1755176004\" width=700 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/1da7cc54fcb9fe877516bb863423f9d8.webm?t=1755176004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700790/extras/1da7cc54fcb9fe877516bb863423f9d8.mp4?t=1755176004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
